      "body": "## Overview\n\nAdd a RedHatAI FP8 variant to QwQ-32B and an EAGLE3 option to the Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct recipe.\n\n## Claims\n\n- Adds the checkpoint and speculative-decoding configuration to the existing pages.\n- Leaves existing defaults unchanged.\n\n## Validation\n\nValidation is pending; this PR is intentionally a draft.\n\n- Passed: `git diff --check`.\n- Planned source validation (not run): from `/home/Roderick-Wu/recipes`, run `pnpm install` if dependencies are missing, then:\n  `node scripts/validate-source.mjs --source vllm --dir /home/Roderick-Wu/recipe-worktrees/qwq-qwen3vl/recipes`\n- Planned serving smoke test (not run): use the generated H100 command on the 8xH100 node, then check `/v1/models` and a short `/v1/chat/completions` request as shown in the other checkpoint PRs.\n\n## Details\n\nThe YAML includes the exact checkpoint references and keeps H100 support claims separate from test verification. AI assistance was used to prepare this change.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill.\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] Design Fit: confines changes to existing recipe files and preserves defaults.\n- [ ] Testing and Validation: pending author validation.\n- [x] Code Quality and Style: `git diff --check` passed.\n- [x] Pull Request Contents: includes checkpoint references and a validation plan.\n</details>\n\n",
