      "changes": 15,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/recipes%2Fmodels%2FQwen%2FQwQ-32B.yaml?ref=489238f1a6194eb65ca122bd2026525cace20230",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "recipes/models/Qwen/QwQ-32B.yaml",
      "patch": "@@ -4,14 +4,15 @@ meta:\n   provider: \"Qwen\"\n   description: \"Qwen's 32B dense reasoning model, validated for Intel Xeon 6 CPU execution.\"\n   date_added: 2026-08-17\n-  date_updated: 2026-09-12\n+  date_updated: 2026-10-30\n   tasks:\n     - text\n   performance_headline: \"Validated for Intel Xeon 6 CPU execution\"\n   related_recipes:\n     - \"Qwen/Qwen3-32B\"\n   hardware:\n     xeon6: verified\n+    h100: supported\n \n model:\n   model_id: \"Qwen/QwQ-32B\"\n@@ -70,6 +71,16 @@ variants:\n     extra_args:\n       - \"--quantization\"\n       - \"awq\"\n+  redhat_fp8_dynamic:\n+    model_id: \"RedHatAI/QwQ-32B-FP8-dynamic\"\n+    precision: fp8\n+    label: \"FP8 Dynamic (RedHatAI)\"\n+    vram_minimum_gb: 39\n+    description: \"RedHatAI FP8 with static per-channel weights and dynamic per-token activation quantization\"\n+    supported_hardware: [arch:sm90, arch:sm100, arch:sm103]\n+    extra_args:\n+      - \"--kv-cache-dtype\"\n+      - \"fp8\"\n \n compatible_strategies:\n   - single_node_tp\n@@ -155,6 +166,8 @@ guide: |\n \n   ## References\n \n+  - [RedHatAI QwQ-32B FP8 Dynamic checkpoint](https://huggingface.co/RedHatAI/QwQ-32B-FP8-dynamic)\n+\n   - [Model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/QwQ-32B)\n   - [W8A8 variant](https://huggingface.co/RedHatAI/QwQ-32B-quantized.w8a8)\n   - [vLLM reasoning outputs](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/reasoning_outputs.html)",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/raw/489238f1a6194eb65ca122bd2026525cace20230/recipes%2Fmodels%2FQwen%2FQwQ-32B.yaml",
      "sha": "55145872ab3502f0b7a0eef088062c1a922f1d79",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 9,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/489238f1a6194eb65ca122bd2026525cace20230/recipes%2Fmodels%2FQwen%2FQwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.yaml",
      "changes": 10,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/contents/recipes%2Fmodels%2FQwen%2FQwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.yaml?ref=489238f1a6194eb65ca122bd2026525cace20230",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "recipes/models/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.yaml",
      "patch": "@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@ meta:\n   provider: \"Qwen\"\n   description: \"Qwen3-VL flagship MoE vision-language model with 235B total / 22B active parameters, supporting images, video, and long context.\"\n   date_added: 2025-09-28\n-  date_updated: 2026-04-17\n+  date_updated: 2026-10-30\n   tasks:\n     - multimodal\n     - text\n@@ -55,8 +55,14 @@ features:\n       - \"1000000\"\n     env:\n       VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN: \"1\"\n+  spec_decoding:\n+    description: \"RedHatAI EAGLE3 speculator with 3 draft tokens\"\n+    args:\n+      - \"--speculative-config\"\n+      - '{\"model\":\"RedHatAI/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-speculator.eagle3\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3,\"method\":\"eagle3\"}'\n \n opt_in_features:\n+  - spec_decoding\n   - text_only\n   - long_context\n \n@@ -337,6 +343,8 @@ guide: |\n \n   ## References\n \n+  - [RedHatAI Qwen3-VL EAGLE3 speculator](https://huggingface.co/RedHatAI/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-speculator.eagle3)\n+\n   - [Model card](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct)\n   - [FP8 checkpoint](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-FP8)\n   - [Qwen3-VL GitHub](https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-VL)",
